{"id":"658696","name":"紫苏叶炒牛肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/658696/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"紫苏叶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉洗净切薄片。","img":"images/658696/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入玉米淀粉先抓匀。","img":"images/658696/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入蚝油，老抽抓拌均匀。","img":"images/658696/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入花生油抓匀锁住水份。","img":"images/658696/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"紫苏洗净改刀切细一些。","img":"images/658696/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油放入牛肉。","img":"images/658696/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将牛肉滑开炒散。","img":"images/658696/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒至八分熟。","img":"images/658696/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入紫苏叶。","img":"images/658696/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"适量生抽调味。","img":"images/658696/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大火快速翻炒均匀即可。","img":"images/658696/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658696/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/658696/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}